<title>FINLAND: RAUMA UNIT TO INVEST $10 MLN IN CHINA.</title>
<headline>RAUMA UNIT TO INVEST $10 MLN IN CHINA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Rauma Oy said in a statement on Tuesday its Nordberg unit would invest $10 million in the manufacture of chrushing plants and chrushers in China.</p>
<p>&quot;Nordberg will start to manufacture chrushing plants and chrushers locally in China, mainly to serve the domestic market but also other growing markets in the Asia-Pacific region,&quot; Rauma said.  </p>
<p>&quot;Nordberg's target is to build a manufacturing unit capable of fully meeting international quality requirements,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
